WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.500
An experiment to describe your surroundings
with Seeing AI.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.230
Seeing AI is an ongoing research project.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:17.380
And in the app, we have included some of our
more experimental features, that you have

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:20.260
to turn those on in the settings.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:26.050
One of these is the ability to describe a
general scene.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:31.470
When you take a photo, the algorithm detects
the objects that it can see.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.339
And tries to find a relationship between them
and describe this in a natural sentence.

00:00:36.339 --> 00:00:42.370
It’s still learning, kind of like a kid
learns to speak.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:47.360
So, as it learns more things In the world
around it, the descriptions will get better

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.409
over time.

00:00:48.409 --> 00:00:52.430
Here’s an example photo I took earlier.

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:54.150
&gt; Processing.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:58.500
&gt; Probably a man sitting on a couch using
a laptop.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.470
&gt; Take picture
&gt; Processing.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:06.920
&gt; A bus that is parked on the side of a road.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.859
&gt; Take picture
&gt; Processing.

00:01:09.859 --> 00:01:14.890
&gt; Probably a box filled with different types
of food on the table.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:18.470
This is just a glimpse at the possibilities
of artificial intelligence.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:22.750
And I can’t wait to see where it goes in
the future.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.610
Microsoft logo appears.

